### Requêtes prêtes à l'emploi
### VS Code : installez l'extension « REST Client » puis cliquez sur « Send Request ».

@base = http://localhost:4000/api
@email = admin@beaute-halal.local
@password = ChangeMoi2026!

### Santé de l'API
GET {{base}}/health

### Informations du salon
GET {{base}}/salon

### Toutes les prestations
GET {{base}}/services

### Prestations mises en avant (page d'accueil)
GET {{base}}/services?featured=true

### Prestations d'une catégorie
GET {{base}}/services?category=entretien

### Une prestation
GET {{base}}/services/retwist

### Galerie
GET {{base}}/gallery

### Galerie filtrée
GET {{base}}/gallery?category=coloration

### Équipe
GET {{base}}/team

### Avis
GET {{base}}/testimonials

### Calendrier des 60 prochains jours
GET {{base}}/availability/days

### Créneaux d'une journée (adaptez la date)
GET {{base}}/availability/slots?date=2026-09-16

### Créer un rendez-vous (adaptez date et heure à un créneau libre)
POST {{base}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceSlug": "retwist",
  "date": "2026-09-16",
  "time": "10:00",
  "firstName": "Awa",
  "lastName": "Traoré",
  "phone": "+225 00 00 00 00",
  "email": "awa@exemple.com",
  "note": "Longueur mi-dos"
}

### Consulter un rendez-vous par sa référence
GET {{base}}/appointments/BH-XXXXXX

### Envoyer un message de contact
POST {{base}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Awa Traoré",
  "email": "awa@exemple.com",
  "phone": "+225 00 00 00 00",
  "message": "Bonjour, je souhaite un renseignement sur le retwist."
}

### ───────────────────────── ADMIN ─────────────────────────

### Connexion (copiez le token dans @token ci-dessous)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Mon compte
GET {{base}}/admin/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compteurs du tableau de bord
GET {{base}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Liste des rendez-vous
GET {{base}}/admin/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rendez-vous en attente
GET {{base}}/admin/appointments?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Confirmer un rendez-vous
PATCH {{base}}/admin/appointments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "confirmed" }

### Annuler un rendez-vous
PATCH {{base}}/admin/appointments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "cancelled", "cancelReason": "Indisponibilité du salon" }

### Créer une prestation
POST {{base}}/admin/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 2,
  "name": "Retwist express",
  "description": "Reprise rapide des racines.",
  "durationMinutes": 75,
  "price": 15000,
  "isFeatured": false
}

### Modifier le tarif d'une prestation
PATCH {{base}}/admin/services/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 22000 }

### Modifier les informations du salon
PUT {{base}}/admin/salon
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_display": "+225 07 00 00 00 00",
  "whatsapp_number": "2250700000000",
  "address_city": "Abidjan"
}

### Modifier les horaires
PUT {{base}}/admin/opening-hours
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hours": [
    { "weekday": 0, "isClosed": true },
    { "weekday": 1, "isClosed": true },
    { "weekday": 2, "isClosed": false, "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "18:00" },
    { "weekday": 3, "isClosed": false, "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "18:00" },
    { "weekday": 4, "isClosed": false, "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "18:00" },
    { "weekday": 5, "isClosed": false, "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "18:00" },
    { "weekday": 6, "isClosed": false, "opensAt": "09:00", "closesAt": "19:00" }
  ]
}

### Ajouter une fermeture exceptionnelle
POST {{base}}/admin/closures
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-12-25", "reason": "Congés" }

### Messages de contact non lus
GET {{base}}/admin/messages?status=new
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Changer son mot de passe
POST {{base}}/admin/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "ChangeMoi2026!",
  "newPassword": "un-mot-de-passe-bien-plus-long"
}
